# Keep host-built artifacts out of image build contexts.
# Critical: never copy host node_modules into the image — the host (macOS/arm64)
# native binaries (e.g. Tailwind 4 oxide) are wrong for the Linux container, and
# a stray copy shadows the deps installed by `npm install` in the Dockerfile.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build

# Python / tooling
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.lint-venv
**/venv
**/.venv

# VCS / local
.git
.gitignore
**/.env
**/.DS_Store
